1
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:21,730
The trial of the Celestial Realm

2
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:23,890
is supposed to be about seeking the Dao.

3
00:00:24,440 --> 00:00:27,090
But because of a century-old grudge,

4
00:00:27,320 --> 00:00:28,610
a manhunt

5
00:00:28,720 --> 00:00:31,050
across star systems took place.

6
00:00:32,160 --> 00:00:34,640
The Blood Ancestor crossed star systems

7
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:36,800
and came to the Thunder Celestial Realm.

8
00:00:37,920 --> 00:00:39,360
A mighty being's rage

9
00:00:39,560 --> 00:00:41,440
spilled endless blood.

10
00:00:42,160 --> 00:00:43,560
In the depths of despair,

11
00:00:43,680 --> 00:00:46,560
Wang Lin received help from his friend Li Yuan

12
00:00:46,840 --> 00:00:49,040
and by borrowing the laws of the heavens and the earth,

13
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:51,600
he fought the Blood Ancestor to the death.

14
00:00:52,760 --> 00:00:55,240
It was a certain death battle

15
00:00:55,520 --> 00:00:59,360
but he ended up slaying the Immortal against all odds.

16
00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:10,850
Renegade Immortal Movie

Battle of the Immortal Slayer

17
00:01:05,440 --> 00:01:10,850
Stay tuned

18
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:29,010
The rules keep changing.

19
00:01:32,600 --> 00:01:37,850
I've been rehearsing every possible outcome.

20
00:01:41,760 --> 00:01:48,290
Once this thought arises, there is no more room for right or wrong.

21
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:56,930
I am resolved to sever this flood

22
00:01:58,800 --> 00:02:03,290
so that my soul can break free from mediocrity,

23
00:02:03,280 --> 00:02:07,650
from loneliness and distinction.

24
00:02:07,880 --> 00:02:12,610
One more step and you'll fall into madness.

25
00:02:12,560 --> 00:02:17,610
Don't fall down.

26
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:20,810
I look towards the top.

27
00:02:20,640 --> 00:02:23,450
Chase !

28
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:26,650
Refined to perfection.

29
00:02:27,960 --> 00:02:32,570
Never retreat, no matter the danger.

30
00:02:32,440 --> 00:02:35,610
I dare to defy the heavens !

31
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:39,450
Always overcome the obstacles,

32
00:02:39,390 --> 00:02:41,810
ignite the seas with blood,

33
00:02:41,720 --> 00:02:46,250
bloom through trials and tribulations.

34
00:02:46,160 --> 00:02:50,890
Even the sharpest thorns

35
00:02:50,760 --> 00:02:55,450
will be reduced into ashes.

36
00:02:55,240 --> 00:02:59,770
What is there to fear ?

37
00:03:04,520 --> 00:03:08,930
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
