38
00:04:23,440 --> 00:04:25,730
1 year later

39
00:04:24,440 --> 00:04:27,910
Void between Thunder
Celestial Realm fragments

40
00:04:31,040 --> 00:04:33,290
Yan Chou
Guard of the Yao Family
Illusory Yin

41
00:04:31,040 --> 00:04:33,290
Ru Yun
Yao Lao's cousin
Early stage Ascendant

42
00:04:31,040 --> 00:04:33,290
Yao Luo
Yao Family's branch member
Peak Late stage Ascendant

43
00:04:46,120 --> 00:04:47,800
He lasted 13 days.

44
00:04:48,240 --> 00:04:50,360
Better than the ones before him.

45
00:04:50,800 --> 00:04:51,760
Young Master,

46
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:54,560
this guy is already at his last breath.

47
00:04:54,880 --> 00:04:55,840
Uncle Chou,

48
00:04:56,120 --> 00:04:58,970
it looks like we need to catch an Illusory Yin cultivator next time

49
00:04:58,800 --> 00:05:00,960
so I can play a few more days.

50
00:05:01,200 --> 00:05:02,000
Alright.

51
00:05:02,120 --> 00:05:03,040
Cousin,

52
00:05:03,760 --> 00:05:06,560
this guy still has a few swords on him.

53
00:05:07,920 --> 00:05:09,280
I won't forget.

54
00:05:10,160 --> 00:05:11,520
They're all yours.

55
00:05:11,720 --> 00:05:13,520
Not to mention these 9 swords,

56
00:05:13,840 --> 00:05:16,240
everything in this Thunder Celestial Realm

57
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:18,040
can become mine

58
00:05:18,040 --> 00:05:19,840
if I wish.

59
00:05:20,200 --> 00:05:22,200
Cousin, you're from the Yao Family,

60
00:05:22,320 --> 00:05:24,160
of course you can get anything you want.

61
00:05:26,560 --> 00:05:27,920
I can't hold on any longer...

62
00:05:34,400 --> 00:05:36,340
If you want my artifacts, take them.

63
00:05:36,200 --> 00:05:38,120
Why would you humiliate me to this extent ?

64
00:05:38,640 --> 00:05:40,760
Even if I become a ghost,

65
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:43,080
I will never let you off !

66
00:05:44,520 --> 00:05:46,200
You're overestimating yourself.

67
00:05:51,080 --> 00:05:52,700
A member of the Li Family,

68
00:05:52,640 --> 00:05:54,280
even in death...

69
00:05:54,080 --> 00:05:56,080
will keep its dignity !

70
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:03,280
Break.

71
00:06:14,160 --> 00:06:15,240
Annihilation

72
00:06:15,560 --> 00:06:16,920
Restriction Heart !

73
00:06:26,040 --> 00:06:27,480
Now die !

74
00:06:50,280 --> 00:06:51,320
Brother Xu...

75
00:06:52,440 --> 00:06:54,040
I won't be able to give you

76
00:06:55,360 --> 00:06:57,080
my Restriction Heart anymore.

77
00:06:58,160 --> 00:06:59,640
Let me see

78
00:06:59,880 --> 00:07:01,600
where exactly

79
00:07:01,920 --> 00:07:04,840
you got those 9 celestial swords.

80
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:06,000
Cousin,

81
00:07:06,280 --> 00:07:07,600
hurry up.

82
00:07:11,720 --> 00:07:13,160
Young Master, retreat !

83
00:07:45,760 --> 00:07:47,680
Who gave you the qualifications

84
00:07:48,560 --> 00:07:50,280
to hurt my friend ?

85
00:07:52,600 --> 00:07:54,400
Spatial Bending !?

86
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:58,370
I know all the Corporeal Yang cultivators who entered the Thunder Celestial Realm,

87
00:07:58,160 --> 00:07:59,800
but who is he !?

88
00:08:04,720 --> 00:08:05,600
Brother Xu...

89
00:08:07,760 --> 00:08:08,920
Help me

90
00:08:09,320 --> 00:08:11,040
to kill them.

91
00:08:14,640 --> 00:08:17,050
Wang Lin's avatar
Corporeal Yang

92
00:08:29,440 --> 00:08:31,440
If he has such a powerful friend,

93
00:08:31,280 --> 00:08:32,840
why didn't he say so earlier !?

94
00:08:49,720 --> 00:08:51,880
How long did you chase my friend ?

95
00:08:50,960 --> 00:08:53,200
Senior, let me speak !

96
00:08:52,960 --> 00:08:54,360
It was the Yao Young Master...

97
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:57,240
How long !?

98
00:08:57,520 --> 00:08:58,490
Thir...

99
00:08:58,520 --> 00:09:00,200
Thirteen days...

100
00:09:00,440 --> 00:09:01,080
Stop !

101
00:09:03,240 --> 00:09:04,970
This is for the first day.

102
00:09:05,920 --> 00:09:07,140
The second day !

103
00:09:08,920 --> 00:09:10,040
The third day !

104
00:09:12,840 --> 00:09:13,770
Stop !

105
00:09:13,880 --> 00:09:15,520
The fourth day !

106
00:09:16,080 --> 00:09:17,120
Fifth...

107
00:09:17,440 --> 00:09:18,490
Sixth...

108
00:09:18,560 --> 00:09:19,360
Seventh !

109
00:09:20,840 --> 00:09:22,280
Thirteenth !

110
00:09:25,720 --> 00:09:26,930
Junior,

111
00:09:27,480 --> 00:09:29,690
you killed a member of the Yao Family.

112
00:09:29,880 --> 00:09:32,800
The Yao Family will exterminate your entire family !

113
00:09:34,560 --> 00:09:35,960
Do you recognize him ?

114
00:09:39,200 --> 00:09:42,080
The aura of the Yao Family's direct bloodline ?

115
00:09:42,760 --> 00:09:43,800
You...!

116
00:09:50,920 --> 00:09:51,680
Brother Li,

117
00:09:51,840 --> 00:09:53,080
I will give you an opportunity.

118
00:09:54,360 --> 00:09:56,250
Whether you can reach Illusory Yin

119
00:09:56,400 --> 00:09:58,040
depends on your luck.

120
00:10:02,400 --> 00:10:05,770
Cave Residence
Thunder Celestial Realm

121
00:10:05,040 --> 00:10:07,780
Li Yuan has been stuck at Peak Ascendant for years

122
00:10:07,800 --> 00:10:09,160
not because he lacks talent

123
00:10:09,800 --> 00:10:11,520
but because he lacked origin energy.

124
00:10:12,760 --> 00:10:14,480
By infusing him with origin energy today,

125
00:10:15,280 --> 00:10:16,920
he may be able to breakthrough.

126
00:10:20,920 --> 00:10:22,120
In such a short time,

127
00:10:22,640 --> 00:10:25,210
I was hunted by an all-powerful Nirvana Cleanser.

128
00:10:25,440 --> 00:10:27,850
Had I chosen to flee and avoid the fight that day,

129
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:29,930
I would have likely become a blood slave

130
00:10:29,960 --> 00:10:31,890
or have died with my Dao exterminated.

131
00:10:32,920 --> 00:10:34,200
To slay this Immortal,

132
00:10:34,400 --> 00:10:35,800
I had to narrowly escape death

133
00:10:36,760 --> 00:10:39,320
and I obtained this Corporeal Yang cultivation.

134
00:10:46,400 --> 00:10:47,800
A defensive formation of this scale

135
00:10:48,280 --> 00:10:49,960
isn't something I could've done before.

136
00:10:51,560 --> 00:10:53,120
The Corporeal Yang realm

137
00:10:53,160 --> 00:10:54,890
is not only a higher cultivation level

138
00:10:54,720 --> 00:10:58,090
but it also grants a higher mastery over the laws of the world.

139
00:11:01,960 --> 00:11:04,650
Refining an entire Celestial Realm fragment into an artifact

140
00:11:05,160 --> 00:11:06,760
really made this trip worthwile.

141
00:11:09,440 --> 00:11:12,650
Thunder Celestial Realm
Fragment Stamp

142
00:11:14,440 --> 00:11:15,240
Wan'er...

143
00:11:15,960 --> 00:11:16,920
Wait for me.

144
00:11:18,320 --> 00:11:20,320
I will definitely go to Planet Dong Lin.

145
00:11:20,720 --> 00:11:23,040
Even if there is only a sliver of a chance to awaken you,

146
00:11:23,800 --> 00:11:25,360
I will not let it go.

147
00:11:30,800 --> 00:11:32,000
Before going to Dong Lin,

148
00:11:32,440 --> 00:11:34,680
I still need to master more celestial spells and artifacts.

149
00:11:36,120 --> 00:11:38,890
This object is formed from half of the Blood Ancestor's blood body,

150
00:11:38,720 --> 00:11:39,920
it's very powerful.

151
00:11:40,880 --> 00:11:42,090
If I refine it a bit,

152
00:11:42,520 --> 00:11:43,600
it may save my life

153
00:11:43,520 --> 00:11:44,760
at a critical moment.

154
00:11:56,040 --> 00:11:57,560
This artifact isn't ordinary.

155
00:11:58,400 --> 00:11:59,760
I have tried several times

156
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:01,880
but I can't imprint my Divine Sense on it.

157
00:12:03,440 --> 00:12:05,610
Could there be another secret to it ?

158
00:12:08,760 --> 00:12:10,120
When I obtained this bone,

159
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:12,560
it was with these celestial swords.

160
00:12:23,960 --> 00:12:25,090
As expected !

161
00:12:29,840 --> 00:12:31,770
The celestial swords and the beast bone

162
00:12:31,920 --> 00:12:34,670
are able to make a faintly perceptible formation.

163
00:12:34,800 --> 00:12:36,360
If not for this nested formation,

164
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:38,560
my Divine Sense would have no way in.

165
00:12:53,280 --> 00:12:56,010
A restriction world was hidden in the sword ?

166
00:13:17,960 --> 00:13:19,520
This restriction is brilliant,

167
00:13:19,480 --> 00:13:21,120
it's unlike anything I've ever seen.

168
00:13:20,960 --> 00:13:23,000
The one who set it is no ordinary Celestial.

169
00:13:23,720 --> 00:13:25,180
To claim this artifact,

170
00:13:25,240 --> 00:13:26,560
I must find the formation's eye

171
00:13:26,800 --> 00:13:28,000
to break the restriction.

172
00:13:40,440 --> 00:13:41,480
I found it !

173
00:14:02,160 --> 00:14:03,680
All these restrictions

174
00:14:04,120 --> 00:14:05,570
are chained together

175
00:14:05,320 --> 00:14:06,810
in a restriction matrix.

176
00:14:07,680 --> 00:14:09,120
To imprint my Divine Sense,

177
00:14:09,920 --> 00:14:10,800
I need to

178
00:14:11,600 --> 00:14:13,120
break all the restrictions at once !

179
00:14:13,800 --> 00:14:14,810
Fall !

180
00:14:40,600 --> 00:14:43,770
Withered Dao Pair

181
00:14:42,680 --> 00:14:45,240
According to the memory of the previous Divine Sense imprint,

182
00:14:45,160 --> 00:14:46,330
this thing

183
00:14:46,200 --> 00:14:47,640
is called the Withered Dao Pair.

184
00:14:48,040 --> 00:14:49,960
It's a true celestial artifact.

185
00:14:50,920 --> 00:14:53,000
It was damaged in the war against the Ancient Gods.

186
00:14:53,360 --> 00:14:54,840
After its master died,

187
00:14:55,200 --> 00:14:57,000
it wasn't fully repaired.

188
00:14:59,360 --> 00:15:00,970
Even in its damaged state,

189
00:15:00,880 --> 00:15:02,560
its power is still astonishing.

190
00:15:04,960 --> 00:15:07,800
It's one of my most powerful artifacts right now.

191
00:15:10,600 --> 00:15:13,490
Yao

192
00:15:11,440 --> 00:15:12,760
Yao Family of Allheaven...

193
00:15:13,760 --> 00:15:15,280
Ever since I killed the Blood Ancestor,

194
00:15:15,760 --> 00:15:17,440
a blood feud was created.

195
00:15:20,560 --> 00:15:21,880
Another talisman ?

196
00:15:23,440 --> 00:15:24,480
This talisman

197
00:15:24,800 --> 00:15:27,280
is extremely similar to the one I obtained from Xu Fenghan.

198
00:15:27,060 --> 00:15:29,370
Note: Xu Fengshan, Illusory Yin from Planet Dong Lin (episode 149)

199
00:15:29,160 --> 00:15:30,610
Origin energy fluctuations !

200
00:15:31,080 --> 00:15:32,570
If not for my improved cultivation,

201
00:15:32,360 --> 00:15:33,810
I wouldn't have detected it.

202
00:15:34,240 --> 00:15:35,920
This should be a special artifact

203
00:15:36,440 --> 00:15:38,080
but I don't know how to use it for now.

204
00:15:43,920 --> 00:15:45,120
Collection Pavilion...

205
00:15:46,840 --> 00:15:49,650
So this Illusory Yin Elder entered the Thunder Celestial Realm

206
00:15:49,680 --> 00:15:52,160
to escort a member of the Yao Family to this pavilion

207
00:15:52,720 --> 00:15:54,080
to obtain celestial spells.

208
00:15:55,480 --> 00:15:58,250
This pavilion was personally built by the Thunder Celestial Emperor

209
00:15:58,200 --> 00:16:00,090
and stores countless celestial spells.

210
00:16:00,600 --> 00:16:03,280
Now, the four great ancient families with a Celestial bloodline

211
00:16:03,600 --> 00:16:05,120
have joined forces to seal this place

212
00:16:05,320 --> 00:16:07,160
and only allow those with a Celestial bloodline to enter

213
00:16:07,480 --> 00:16:08,800
in search of opportunities.

214
00:16:10,320 --> 00:16:11,390
The Yao Family

215
00:16:12,120 --> 00:16:13,360
is one of them.

216
00:16:20,600 --> 00:16:21,400
Brother Xu,

217
00:16:22,120 --> 00:16:23,000
thank you.

218
00:16:23,880 --> 00:16:26,600
But my Origin Soul can't withstand that much origin energy.

219
00:16:26,840 --> 00:16:28,080
It seems that

220
00:16:28,520 --> 00:16:30,450
I'm not fated to reach Illusory Yin.

221
00:16:32,280 --> 00:16:34,090
Brother Li, don't underestimate yourself.

222
00:16:34,560 --> 00:16:37,250
The origin energy within you will keep nourishing your Origin Soul.

223
00:16:37,280 --> 00:16:38,760
When it's fully absorbed,

224
00:16:39,040 --> 00:16:40,440
you will reach Illusory Yin.

225
00:16:41,120 --> 00:16:42,180
That day

226
00:16:42,520 --> 00:16:44,090
may come sooner or later.

227
00:16:43,920 --> 00:16:45,690
Success lies in perseverance.

228
00:16:47,280 --> 00:16:48,860
I'm returning what belongs to you.

229
00:16:52,560 --> 00:16:53,620
Keep them safe.

230
00:16:53,720 --> 00:16:55,320
These artifacts and celestial jades

231
00:16:55,280 --> 00:16:56,900
will also help your cultivation.

232
00:16:58,800 --> 00:17:00,630
This is a Restriction-Breaking Ancient Mirror,

233
00:16:59,280 --> 00:17:02,490
Restriction-Breaking
Ancient Mirror

234
00:17:00,440 --> 00:17:02,290
there are very few of these left.

235
00:17:02,520 --> 00:17:04,520
If you ever need to break a restriction quickly,

236
00:17:04,760 --> 00:17:06,520
it may be of help to you.

237
00:17:07,880 --> 00:17:09,400
I can no longer see through

238
00:17:09,720 --> 00:17:11,160
Brother Xu's cultivation.

239
00:17:12,120 --> 00:17:14,040
As for slaying that Immortal...

240
00:17:15,360 --> 00:17:17,420
It was only possible thanks to Brother Li's restrictions.

241
00:17:17,320 --> 00:17:18,880
Although the Blood Ancestor isn't dead yet,

242
00:17:19,440 --> 00:17:20,840
he no longer poses a threat.

243
00:17:21,600 --> 00:17:22,550
Brother Li,

244
00:17:23,200 --> 00:17:25,490
I wish to go to a place called the Collection Pavilion

245
00:17:25,280 --> 00:17:26,770
to obtain celestial spells.

246
00:17:27,240 --> 00:17:29,450
But this place is sealed by restrictions.

247
00:17:29,720 --> 00:17:32,890
Brother Li is far more familiar with the Thunder Celestial Realm than I am.

248
00:17:33,080 --> 00:17:34,530
Do you want to come with me ?

249
00:17:35,080 --> 00:17:36,620
I will follow Brother Xu

250
00:17:36,440 --> 00:17:38,040
wherever you go.

251
00:17:38,400 --> 00:17:41,770
Celestial Guiding Palace
Thunder Celestial Realm

252
00:17:39,600 --> 00:17:40,360
Brother Xu,

253
00:17:40,800 --> 00:17:42,490
The Collection Pavilion is to the southwest

254
00:17:42,280 --> 00:17:44,330
and there are several ancient Celestial ruins nearby.

255
00:17:44,160 --> 00:17:45,610
Do you want to explore them too ?

256
00:17:45,840 --> 00:17:47,700
If Brother Li thinks they're worth visiting,

257
00:17:47,600 --> 00:17:49,090
then the more opportunities,

258
00:17:48,920 --> 00:17:50,200
the better.

259
00:17:55,560 --> 00:17:57,000
This rundown place

260
00:17:56,080 --> 00:17:58,850
Celestial Welcoming
Palace

261
00:17:57,000 --> 00:17:58,560
has probably been cleaned up already.

262
00:17:59,440 --> 00:18:01,040
What's there to look around for ?

263
00:18:01,360 --> 00:18:02,890
This Celestial Welcoming Palace

264
00:18:03,320 --> 00:18:05,240
seems to be a place where ancient Celestials traded.

265
00:18:05,640 --> 00:18:07,210
Brother Xu's guess is right.

266
00:18:07,560 --> 00:18:08,840
According to ancient records,

267
00:18:08,960 --> 00:18:10,410
in these kinds of Celestial markets,

268
00:18:10,360 --> 00:18:12,160
the largest shop is always to the east.

269
00:18:22,040 --> 00:18:23,920
My Divine Sense found nothing unusual.

270
00:18:25,440 --> 00:18:26,280
See ?

271
00:18:26,680 --> 00:18:28,040
Not even a single hair left.

272
00:18:30,640 --> 00:18:31,320
Brother Xu,

273
00:18:31,640 --> 00:18:33,650
please strike this spot with full force.

274
00:18:40,560 --> 00:18:42,720
There really was a hidden formation.

275
00:18:43,880 --> 00:18:45,720
It's a pity this formation is too old,

276
00:18:46,120 --> 00:18:47,720
its celestial spiritual energy is gone,

277
00:18:47,720 --> 00:18:48,880
it's a dead formation.

278
00:18:50,240 --> 00:18:50,970
